#15 17.32 ## 3.7.2 / 2025-09-09
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ### Enhancements:
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 * `gem sources --prepend` and `--append` allow finer grained control of
#15 17.32   sources. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8901](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8901) by martinemde
#15 17.32 * Improve `gem sources --remove` output. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8909](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8909) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 * Make `gem sources` output more clear. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8938](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8938) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 * Use IMDSv2 for S3 instance credentials. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#7709](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/7709) by
#15 17.32   folbricht-stripe
#15 17.32 * Installs bundler 2.7.2 as a default gem.
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ### Bug fixes:
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 * Fix "did you mean" suggestions for unknown commands. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8948](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8948) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 * Fix trailing slashes not considered by `gem sources --remove`. Pull
#15 17.32   request [#8939](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8939) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ## 3.7.1 / 2025-07-21
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ### Enhancements:
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 * Fix regression in presence of RVM gems. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8854](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8854) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 * Restore parsing "--" as an unknown platform rather than crashing. Pull
#15 17.32   request [#8846](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8846) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 * Installs bundler 2.7.1 as a default gem.
