#15 17.32 ## 3.7.0 / 2025-07-16
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ### Security:
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 * Update vendored resolv to 0.6.2. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8831](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8831) by hsbt
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ### Breaking changes:
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 * Stop generating binstubs with support for RubyGems before 2.6.2. Pull
#15 17.32   request [#8833](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8833) by
#15 17.32   deivid-rodriguez
#15 17.32 * Drop support for Ruby 3.1. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8634](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8634) by segiddins
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 ### Enhancements:
#15 17.32 
#15 17.32 * Update SPDX license list as of 2025-07-01. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8829](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8829) by
#15 17.32   github-actions[bot]
#15 17.32 * Add `push_rubygem` as a default scope for `gem signin` command. Pull
#15 17.32   request [#8672](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8672) by hsbt
#15 17.32 * Update bundled tls certs. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8731](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8731) by segiddins
#15 17.32 * Install the best matching gem for the current platform in `gem install`.
#15 17.32   Pull request [#8751](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8751) by
#15 17.32   segiddins
#15 17.32 * Move most of `Bundler::GemHelpers` to `Gem::Platform`. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8703](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8703) by segiddins
#15 17.32 * Ensure that `Gem::Platform` parses strings to a fix point. Pull request
#15 17.32   [#8584](https://github.com/rubygems/rubygems/pull/8584) by segiddins
#15 17.32 * Installs bundler 2.7.0 as a default gem.
#15 17.32 
